{"text":"Once it is uttered and you have taken ownership of it, the destination is taken care of and the journey can begin. And so I got down to the most important work, figuring out what steps would get me to being an actor, the actor I wanted so badly to be. I had an action plan, something to work towards, getting into the Yale School of Drama for acting training. To go after my goal to attend the Yale School of Drama, meant that I would have to confront my fear of failure, of not being good enough. I knew it was a great acting program and I wanted to be at the best program possible if I was to really give this acting thing a fair shot. But I felt inexperienced. We don't have, at least we didn't have, a theater library in Kenya.","words":[{"text":"Once","start":0.0,"end":0.88},{"text":"it","start":0.88,"end":1.1},{"text":"is","start":1.1,"end":1.4},{"text":"uttered","start":1.4,"end":1.78},{"text":"and","start":1.78,"end":2.36},{"text":"you","start":2.36,"end":2.48},{"text":"have","start":2.48,"end":2.74},{"text":"taken","start":2.74,"end":3.46},{"text":"ownership","start":3.46,"end":3.96},{"text":"of","start":3.96,"end":4.3},{"text":"it","start":4.3,"end":4.56,"punct":","},{"text":"the","start":4.78,"end":4.92},{"text":"destination","start":4.92,"end":5.4},{"text":"is","start":5.4,"end":5.9},{"text":"taken","start":5.9,"end":6.14},{"text":"care","start":6.14,"end":6.54},{"text":"of","start":6.54,"end":6.78},{"text":"and","start":6.78,"end":6.98},{"text":"the","start":6.98,"end":7.14},{"text":"journey","start":7.14,"end":7.44},{"text":"can","start":7.44,"end":7.94},{"text":"begin","start":7.94,"end":8.38,"punct":"."},{"text":"And","start":9.58,"end":9.78},{"text":"so","start":9.78,"end":9.96},{"text":"I","start":9.96,"end":10.1},{"text":"got","start":10.1,"end":10.26},{"text":"down","start":10.26,"end":10.6},{"text":"to","start":10.6,"end":10.84},{"text":"the","start":10.84,"end":10.96},{"text":"most","start":10.96,"end":11.16},{"text":"important","start":11.16,"e